<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx7.SSx3" title="In Appendix ‣ DualAlign: Generating Clinically Grounded Synthetic Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Keyword Distribution</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx7.SSx4" title="In Appendix ‣ DualAlign: Generating Clinically Grounded Synthetic Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Example Note</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx7.SSx5" title="In Appendix ‣ DualAlign: Generating Clinically Grounded Synthetic Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Temporal Context</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx7.SSx6" title="In Appendix ‣ DualAlign: Generating Clinically Grounded Synthetic Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Keywords for Each Category</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx7.SSx7" title="In Appendix ‣ DualAlign: Generating Clinically Grounded Synthetic Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Annotation Guideline</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
  <a id="license-tr" href="https://info.arxiv.org/help/license/index.html#licenses-available">
